@@ -2549,3 +2549,3 @@ return: answer
-# Adapt this operation's CURRENT receiving data. A schema/model argument
-# never supplies a missing catalog, coverage, mode, or physical evidence.
-# All maps, including children, are still resolved by admit_template_frame.
+# The graph-data adapter decodes only the optional two-field representation.
+# A value producer can pass the SAME two components directly below;neither
+# path allocates a context graph or mutates the shared receiving record.
@@ -2553,2 +2552,0 @@ fn: lmx_implements_admit_receiving_context (@: LmxArena arena; @: Lmx value; @:
