+            return: c.LMX_IMPLEMENTS_UNKNOWN
+        ---
+    ---
+return: lmx_implements_admit_receiving_parts(arena, value, req, frame, source, source_references)
+
+# This operation's CURRENT typed value components. A schema/model argument
+# never supplies missing catalog,coverage,mode or physical evidence. All
+# maps,including children,still go through the one templates resolver.
+fn: lmx_implements_admit_receiving_parts (@: LmxArena arena; @: Lmx value; @: Lmx req; @: Lmx frame; @: Lmx source; @: Lmx source_references) int
+    @: Lmx catalog
+    @: Lmx references
